WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.545
Crypto is freedom.

00:00:01.545 --> 00:00:05.280
Crypto is revolutionary.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.080
What problem does this solve?

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.890
That's still the question I ask.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.230
The fact of the matter is
it's still a lot easier

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:18.340
to do business with a
good old Yankee dollar.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.860
We know that
putting power back

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.530
into the hands of the
individual and away

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.270
from centralized
authorities is going

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:29.010
to be a powerful concept
for the whole world.

